{
  "_about": "Central Pedal touch screens. kind: spi = a small screen on the GPIO pins (Central Pedal draws its own remote on it; HDMI 1 can show a copy), hdmi = a touch monitor on HDMI 1 (shows the app; its touch is USB), dsi = a screen on the ribbon-cable display port (shows the app). config = lines for config.txt; video = the mode forced on HDMI 1 when the screen does not say its size; driver = the maker's overlay, downloaded when the screen is picked (built-in ones need nothing). pins = GPIO pins the screen uses (kept free of buttons).",
  "groups": [
    { "id": "spi", "name": "Small screens on the GPIO pins (2.2\" - 4\")" },
    { "id": "hdmi", "name": "HDMI touch screens (USB touch)" },
    { "id": "dsi", "name": "Ribbon-cable (DSI) touch screens" }
  ],
